+// thread (`panelStateId: threadId`), tab id = plugin:action:serialized params,
+// an existing tab is reactivated, only the active tab renders under a slot
+// keyed by plugin/action/generation with params memoized by `paramsJson`, a
+// thread is open in at most one pane, and the route follows the focused pane.
+// The opener mode "focused" models the proposed upstream sidebar opener
+// (focused pane, resolved at invocation); "none" is today's sidebar (no
+// handler); "declined" is a refused open. Synthetic data only; not the host.
